---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-kent-blue">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last Updated: October 2024</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 text-justify">
      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 p-4 rounded-lg mb-6">
        <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Important Notice for Google Ads Compliance:</p>
        <p class="mt-1">24x7 RO Support is an independent, third-party service provider. We are NOT an authorized service center for any specific brand.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">1. Trademark Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>All brand names, logos, and trademarks (including but not limited to Kent RO, Aquaguard, Pureit, AO Smith, LG, Livpure, Havells, V-Guard, Zero B) mentioned on this website belong to their respective owners. They are used here solely for the purpose of identification and compatibility description.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">2. Service Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>We provide independent repair and maintenance services. Any use of brand names does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by the brand owners. Our services are generally meant for out-of-warranty products.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">3. Website Content</h2>
        <p>While we strive to keep the information on this website accurate and up-to-date, we make no warranties of any kind regarding the completeness or accuracy of the content. Prices and service availability are subject to change without prior notice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>